  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency relief for 5 families left homeless</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TECHO is an experienced organization that works to improve the living conditions of the population in informal settlements throughout Latin America. On this occasion, we are working to raise funds to build emergency housing for 5 families who lost their homes to a fire. This project will support them not only in building a new home but also in starting a new life.</narrative>
  </description>
